    # --- FLASHBACK DREAM SCENE ---
    scene bg dream_park with dissolve

    b "Yo ???, wait up... you know that I'm not that athletic..."

    "Byron catches his breath, hands on his knees, panting heavily from running."

    k "Aw c'mon Bry, we only ran a few miles. You're already exhausted? I swear if we go to college soon, you'll be so exhausted in P.E. class there."

