    b "Uh, what is it?"

    "Maria sighs softly, gazing at Byron with eyes full of tenderness, worry, and pride."

    m "Just be safe, okay? I don't want anything bad to happen to my sweetheart. Do you understand that?"

    b "Yes Ma, I promise with all my heart."

    m "Just make sure you and Kishi end up okay. I'm rooting for you too, hehe."

    b "Ma!"

    m "Ay sus, pasimple ka pa!"

    b "Ma naman eh..."

    # --- ENROLLMENT SCENE ---
    scene bg byron_bedroom with dissolve

